OL,3,GNEWSANew contract will make it 'easier'
OL,4,Ato get GP appointments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new contract with general
OL,7,Fpractitioners (GPs) will make it
OL,8,F"easier" for patients to get
OL,9,Fappointments, the health minister has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe Department of Health (DoH) said it
OL,13,Fwill give an additional #40m across two
OL,14,Fyears for "improvements in patient
OL,15,Faccess and primary care activity".
OL,17,FLast year, GP partners in Northern
OL,18,FIreland voted in favour of taking
OL,19,Fcollective action as part of their
OL,20,Ffight for increased funding for general
OL,21,Fpractice.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
