OL,3,GNEWSANew contract will make it 'easier'
OL,4,Ato get GP appointments
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobbie Butler said he welcomes the NI
OL,7,FGeneral Practitioners Committee's
OL,8,F(NIGPC) "commitment to rebuild a
OL,9,Fconstructive working relationship with
OL,10,Fthe department and to end the current
OL,11,Fcollective action".
